<title>FINLAND: VALMET WINS FIM 30 MLN AUTOMATION ORDERS.</title>
<headline>VALMET WINS FIM 30 MLN AUTOMATION ORDERS.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish engineering group Valmet Oy said in a statement on Tuesday its automation arm had won orders worth almost 30 million markka from the Finnish energy industry.</p>
<p>&quot;In less than two months, Valmet Automation Inc has received orders worth nearly FIM 30 million ($6.6 million) from the Finnish energy industry,&quot; it said.  </p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-0-6805 0245</p>
